# SHA-256 of every file bundled from outside this repository (ovation#167).
# Fonts from google/fonts at commit 809e4d8b8d7e, each verified against the git blob
# GitHub lists for it at that commit before it was committed here. Check with
#   shasum -a 256 -c Ovation/Resources/bundled-resources.sha256
# DanWright-black.pdf is Dan's vector mark (Watermark/Logo Pdf/DanWright black.pdf)
# redrawn into a fresh PDF, which drops the Illustrator editing data, layer list and
# XMP the original carried. Rasterised at 1856 by 460 it matches the original on every
# pixel (54,959 visible), and it draws with paths, never an embedded image.
